<%= header_section("Your 1099-K transaction report") %>
<div>
  <% if @report_csv_url.present? %>
    <p>Please click this <%= link_to "link", @report_csv_url %> to download the transaction report for your <%= @year %> 1099-K.</p>
  <% else %>
    <p>We've attached the transaction report for your <%= @year %> 1099-K to this email.</p>
  <% end %>
  <p>The report lists every charge included in your form's gross amount, matched to the corresponding Gumroad sale. The gross amount includes sales tax collected at checkout, and transactions are grouped into tax years by the date the funds became available rather than the date of the charge.</p>
</div>
